;
; How Pivot files a control profile in MYRA (pivot_rules.h PV3): its
; number, how many switches, the dwell time and scan step in ms, the scan
; order and the smallest target side in pixels. limits.eve says what the
; values may mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXPIVOT(profile:i2) = switches:i1! ^ dwell:i4! ^ step:i5! ^ order:i1! ^ side:i5!
